Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.00,0:06:37.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《007系列之太空城》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.40,0:01:02.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在情况怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How we doing, Richard?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.19,0:01:05.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会提早十五分钟 越过英国海岸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should pass over the English coast 15 minutes ahead of time, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.36,0:01:08.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以我们背载的货品来说 成绩很不俗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, with this load on our back, that's good going.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.53,0:01:10.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皇家空军 值得信赖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just trust the RAF, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.87,0:01:50.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 搞什么鬼?  - 太空梭点火了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell is that? - The shuttle ignition.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.93,0:02:09.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 消失了?  - 垦月者号怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Disappeared? - And what happened to the Moonraker?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.43,0:02:14.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.02,0:02:18.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了 首相 我马上办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, yes, of course, Minister. Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.69,0:02:29.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钱班霓 007从非洲回来了没?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moneypenny, is 007 back from that African job?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.57,0:02:30.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还有一项任务在身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's on his last leg, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.62,0:02:42.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再高一点 我的耳朵就会爆裂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any higher, Mr. Bond, my ears will pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.84,0:02:49.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我不会再跟别人 一起搭飞机了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think I'm ever going to fly with anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.59,0:02:51.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说得对极了 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're so right, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.23,0:03:01.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就把你就留在这里 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is where we leave you, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.90,0:03:04.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太仓促了吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little premature, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.24,0:03:10.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你旅途愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enjoy your flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.05,0:09:01.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 早安 钱班霓 - 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good morning, Moneypenny. - James.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.84,0:09:03.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么这么晚?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why are you so late?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.34,0:09:06.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没穿降落伞从飞机上掉下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fell out of an airplane without a parachute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.72,0:09:10.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谁在里面?  - Q和国防部长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's in there? - Q and the Minister of Defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.10,0:09:11.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不相信我吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't believe me, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.85,0:09:15.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快进去吧 - 是的 钱班霓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And you should go right in. - Yes, Moneypenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.52,0:09:22.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 终于来了 007 - 早安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 007. At last. - Good morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.40,0:09:24.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是国防部长佛雷克葛瑞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you know Frederick Gray, Minister of Defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.07,0:09:26.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 中校 - 部长 Q\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Commander. - Minister. Q.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.82,0:09:28.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,007啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}007.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.04,0:09:32.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者号?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moonraker?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.04,0:09:36.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你对垦月者号知道多少?  - 我只在报章上看过 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you know about Moonraker? - What I read in the newspaper, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.04,0:09:39.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么你知道 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you'll know that Moonraker, the space shuttle,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.13,0:09:40.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们正在用747客机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was being flown over here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.21,0:09:42.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,运送美国人借我们的 垦月者号到这儿来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on loan from the Americans on the back of a 747.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.71,0:09:44.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞机在育康坠毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, which crashed somewhere in the Yukon,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.97,0:09:47.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞机和太空梭完全毁掉 对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}aircraft and shuttle totally destroyed, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.26,0:09:51.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是官方的版本 - 实情令人困扰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's the official version. - The truth is rather more disturbing, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.35,0:09:52.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.40,0:10:03.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是坠机现场 残骸撒落的范围广阔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, that's the scene of the crash. Wreckage strewn over a large area.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.69,0:10:05.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机身就只剩下这么多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all that's left of the fuselage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.53,0:10:07.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已彻底搜查过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been through it with a fine-toothed comb,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.53,0:10:10.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却没发现垦月者号的残骸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but there's no sign of Moonraker, not a trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.12,0:10:12.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说太空梭在半空被劫持?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you suggesting the shuttle was hijacked in midair?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.70,0:10:14.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就交给你去调查了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's for you to find out, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.00,0:10:17.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太空梭是由 在加州的崔斯工业制造\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The shuttles are built in California by Drax Industries.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.54,0:10:22.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 我们负责 这太空梭的安全 指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. We were responsible for the safety of that shuttle, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.50,0:10:25.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国政府相当关注这件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The United States government is justifiably concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.76,0:10:29.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想像得到 从加州开始调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can imagine. Then, California must be the place to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.68,0:10:32.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 同意 - 千万别出错 007\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I agree. - Don't make any mistakes, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.76,0:10:36.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次的情况相当严重 我们必须把太空梭找回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The situation is critical. We've got to find that shuttle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.35,0:10:37.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.52,0:10:40.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若没有其他问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that's all, gentlemen...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.56,0:10:44.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 我有东西给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a minute, 007. I've got something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.45,0:10:49.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把右边的袖子卷起来 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roll up your right sleeve, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.82,0:10:52.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在这快成为标准装备了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is now being issued as standard equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.83,0:10:54.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把它系在腕上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strap it on your wrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.04,0:11:02.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是由腕肌肉神经冲脉启动的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's activated by nerve impulses from the wrist muscles.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.50,0:11:03.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.21,0:11:08.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 007!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, thank you, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.80,0:11:11.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你小心点 好吗?  - 知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Be careful, will you? - Yes, Q.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.30,0:11:14.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,共有十枚镖 五枚蓝色的 可以穿透盔甲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten darts, five blue-tipped with armor piercing heads,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.51,0:11:18.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五枚红色的渗有氰化物 半分钟内致人于死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}five red-tipped, cyanide coated, causing death in 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.81,0:11:22.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常新奇 在圣诞礼品店购买的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very novel, Q. You must get them in the stores for Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.81,0:11:24.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.70,0:11:40.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 欢迎来到加州 邦德先生 - 我已经爱上这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Welcome to California, Mr. Bond. - I like it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.84,0:11:54.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫柯琳杜弗尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Corinne Dufour.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.26,0:11:56.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会带我四处参观吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and you're going to be showing me around, are you, Corinne?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.02,0:12:01.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我只是崔斯企业的 一个谦卑驾驶员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I'm just a humble pilot in the service of the Drax Corporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.61,0:12:17.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是崔斯庄园 你看到的一切都属于崔斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the Drax estate now. Everything you see belongs to Mr. Drax.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.66,0:12:21.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他拥有很多 不是吗?  - 他想要的都已经有了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Owns a lot, doesn't he? - What he doesn't own, he doesn't want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.04,0:12:28.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快到主建筑物了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're approaching the main complex now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.88,0:12:32.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者号 就是在这里制造的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's where the Moonraker shuttle is made?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.72,0:12:35.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 工场 飞机库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right, workshops, hangars,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.72,0:12:39.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,设计和实验大楼 检验中心等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}design and experimental blocks, test centers, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.93,0:12:41.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,令人印象深刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.82,0:12:55.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说雨果崔斯 很沉迷于征服宇宙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd heard that Hugo Drax is obsessed with the conquest of space.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.87,0:13:00.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在相信了 老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I can believe it. Good Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.13,0:13:12.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,崔斯大宅 一砖一瓦均购自法国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Drax residence. Every stone brought from France.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.76,0:13:16.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 很可爱 不是吗?  - 很宏伟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cute, isn't it? - Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.76,0:13:18.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他何不连艾菲尔铁塔也买下?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't he buy the Eiffel Tower as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.60,0:13:22.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有 只是法国政府不让铁塔出口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He did, but the French government refused him an export permit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.66,0:13:42.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 她们是正在受训的太空人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look there. Those are the astronaut trainees.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.83,0:13:47.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,崔斯先生独力资助 这个训练计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Drax is financing the entire training program out of his own pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.46,0:13:51.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的投资眼光非常独到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He seems to have an eye for a good investment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.11,0:14:15.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,崔斯先生会在划厅 接见邦德先生 杜弗尔小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Drax will see Mr. Bond in the drawing room, Miss Dufour.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.24,0:14:18.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 - 这边走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you, Cavendish. - This way, please, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.86,0:14:59.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦德先生来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Bond, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.62,0:15:04.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 邦德先生 - 崔斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Bond. - Mr. Drax.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.75,0:15:09.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在她们离开前 容我介绍 鲁宝斯基女伯爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Allow me to present, before they leave us, Countess Lubinski,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.92,0:15:14.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.05,0:15:21.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们久仰大名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, my dear fellow, your reputation precedes you, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.34,0:15:25.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很荣幸贵国政府派你负责 这个微妙的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm honored that your government should send you on so delicate a mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.81,0:15:27.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,微妙 崔斯先生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Delicate, Mr. Drax?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.31,0:15:31.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲身前来为我的损失道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, to apologize in person for the loss of my space shuttle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.73,0:15:36.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王尔德会怎么说?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How would Oscar Wilde have put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.28,0:15:40.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"损失一艘飞机也许是不幸"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"To lose one aircraft may be regarded as a misfortune,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.66,0:15:44.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"损失两艘就是粗心大意"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"to lose two seems like carelessness."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.04,0:15:52.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,崔斯先生 当我们调查出 垦月者号的下落后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, an apology will be made to the American government, Mr. Drax,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.17,0:15:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我国自会向美国政府道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when we've discovered why there was no trace of the Moonraker in that wreckage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.38,0:16:00.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的忠诚真值得尊敬 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your loyalty commands respect, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.84,0:16:04.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在一个非常适合的时候来到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have arrived at a propitious moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.68,0:16:08.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是贵国对西方文化的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}coincident with your country's one indisputable contribution
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.10,0:16:10.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重大贡献\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to Western civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.02,0:16:12.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下午茶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Afternoon tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.61,0:16:18.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你要吃黄瓜三明治吗?  - 谢谢 我不吃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- May I press you to a cucumber sandwich? - Thank you, no, nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.49,0:16:21.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整艘太空梭 是在加州制造的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The shuttle, is it made entirely here in California?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.40,0:16:24.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我在世界各地的子公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I own a number of subsidiaries throughout the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.12,0:16:25.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生产零件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}producing components.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.95,0:16:29.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要征服宇宙 必须为人类的将来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The conquest of space represents an investment in the future
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.12,0:16:32.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作出投资 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the entire human race, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.33,0:16:37.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以要尽取各国之长处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is, therefore, logical to seek out the best that each nation has to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.92,0:16:43.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是说人还是技术?  - 两者都是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you referring to people or skills? - Both, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.31,0:16:57.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我来得太早了吗?  - 一点都不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Am I too soon? - Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.15,0:17:00.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我确定邦德先生 很渴望开始参观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure Mr. Bond is eager to start his tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.57,0:17:04.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杜佛尔小姐 会带你见向导妙算博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Dufour will escort you to Dr. Goodhead who will show you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.32,0:17:06.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么问题尽管发问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask anything you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.53,0:17:10.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你的合作 - 别客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you for being so cooperative. - A pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.30,0:17:26.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去照顾邦德先生 要确定他会有危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look after Mr. Bond. See that some harm comes to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.93,0:17:32.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妙算博士就在右边第一间房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll find Dr. Goodhead first on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.64,0:17:37.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你的指引 - 有什么需要 请随便吩咐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh. Thank you for the ride. - Call on me if you need anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.84,0:18:02.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,午安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.30,0:18:04.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有何贵干?  - 是的 我叫邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I help you? - Yes. My name is Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.88,0:18:07.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹姆斯邦德 我找妙算博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James Bond. I'm looking for Dr. Goodhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.68,0:18:11.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你刚刚找到她 - 是个女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You just found her. - A woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.39,0:18:16.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的观察力果然名不虚传 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your powers of observation do you credit, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.27,0:18:18.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的朋友叫我做詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James, to my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.15,0:18:20.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,荷莉妙算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holly Goodhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.69,0:18:26.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你在这里接受太空人训练吗?  - 我已接受过全盘训练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you training to be an astronaut? - I'm fully trained.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.11,0:18:29.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是从太空总署 太空管理部被借来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On loan from NASA, the Space Administration.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.74,0:18:33.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦德先生 我想我们最好开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Mr. Bond, I guess we'd better get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.91,0:18:38.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不想浪费时间 和失去垦月者号 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't want to lose time as well as a space shuttle, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.55,0:18:47.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是垦月者号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is it, the Moonraker.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.63,0:18:50.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以用火箭发射到太空 或者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Capable of being launched into space by rocket...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.14,0:18:52.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者围绕地球运行 再重返太空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Orbiting the Earth and reentering the atmosphere to land
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.43,0:18:54.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像普通飞机般降落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like any conventional aircraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.02,0:19:04.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是训练用的离心机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the centrifuge training.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.11,0:19:08.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,模拟在太空时的重力状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It simulates the gravity force you feel when shot into space.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.54,0:19:16.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,速度由上面的指导员控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The speed is controlled by the instructor from up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.87,0:19:18.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你何不试试?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not try it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.50,0:19:22.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有何不可?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.47,0:19:32.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 牢牢扣好 - 知道 博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Strap yourself in firmly. - Yes, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.14,0:19:36.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 你的手臂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now your arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.77,0:19:39.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是预防你把自己打昏的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's to prevent you from knocking yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.31,0:19:40.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.69,0:19:50.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,速度有多快?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How fast does it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.99,0:19:55.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最高可达二十度重力 但那足以致命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can go up to 20 Gs, but that would be fatal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.16,0:19:57.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三度重力相等于 飞机起飞的压力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three Gs is equivalent to take-off pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.00,0:20:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很多人会在七度时昏过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most people pass out at seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.08,0:20:03.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会是个很好的推销员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You make a great saleswoman.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.67,0:20:07.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不用担心 我们叫这个是"胆小鬼的按钮"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to worry. This is what we call a "Chicken Switch."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.80,0:20:09.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把手指放在按钮上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just keep your finger on that button,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.97,0:20:12.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当你感到压力过大时 一按下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the moment the pressure gets too much for you, release the button
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.51,0:20:15.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 就会把电流给截断 - 就这样简单?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and the power's cut off. - Just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.01,0:20:20.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连70岁的老人家 也可以抵受三度重力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Mr. Bond. A 70-year-old can take 3 Gs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.48,0:20:25.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问题是 你要找个七十岁老翁不容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the trouble is there is never a 70-year-old around when you need one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.07,0:20:33.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你找我吗?  - 崔斯先生请你给他电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You want me? - Mr. Drax says to telephone him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.95,0:20:39.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我到办公室去打电话 你开始吧 我很快回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I'll call him from my office. You go ahead. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.75,0:20:43.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,指导员会监督整个过程 好好享受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The instructor will supervise the session. Enjoy yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.59,0:20:55.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 我们正好好招待他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. We're taking good care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.04,0:23:28.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真不知道会发生什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what could've happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.83,0:23:31.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是操纵装置出了问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something must've gone wrong with the controls.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.64,0:23:48.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.01,0:24:24.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈给了我一张列明 首次约会不能做的清单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mother gave me a list of things not to do on a first date.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.35,0:24:27.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用不着了 我并非为那个而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you won't need it. That's not what I came for.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.02,0:24:31.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你要什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. What do you want then?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.69,0:24:38.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要找资料 这会让你心碎吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would your feelings be shattered if I were to say information?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.48,0:24:42.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么我要告诉你任何事情?  - 为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why should I tell you anything? - Why, indeed?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.08,0:24:50.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太放肆了 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You presume a great deal, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.14,0:25:10.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了制造垦月者号 和训练太空人外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What goes on here besides the manufacture of Moonraker?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.31,0:25:12.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里还有什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the astronaut training program?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.02,0:25:17.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里还有其他实验室 但现在没有什么大事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are other laboratories, but not much is happening now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.65,0:25:19.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.57,0:25:24.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从前曾进行机密的实验 但一切都被移走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were working on something very secret, but everything's been moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.78,0:25:26.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,移到哪去了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where to?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.04,0:25:31.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.75,0:25:40.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你妈妈的清单怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about that list of your mother's?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.71,0:25:43.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从来都不认识字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never learned to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.40,0:26:43.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.07,0:26:47.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把我寻找资料的 欲望刺激起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You whetted my appetite for information.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.70,0:26:51.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里有保险箱吗? 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there a safe in here? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.74,0:26:55.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.96,0:27:40.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好惊人!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.00,0:27:45.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里 看到了吗?  你拥有一个黄金心灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you are, you see? You have a heart of gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.76,0:27:47.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十八开的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eighteen karat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.46,0:28:25.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.50,0:28:28.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你先走 我去把灯关上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you go first. I'll turn off the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.64,0:28:35.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.19,0:28:46.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好好保重 - 你也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take care of yourself. - And you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.87,0:30:25.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, my dear Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.87,0:30:30.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她们是黛莉笛儿小姐 和麦托小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Mademoiselle Deladier and La Signorina del Mateo.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.00,0:30:33.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你们好 - 吃午饭时再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ladies. - I'll see you at lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.30,0:30:39.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可惜你要离开 这是好运动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A pity you leave us. Such good sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.30,0:30:41.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非你是雉鸡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless you're a pheasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.72,0:30:46.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 邦德先生.用我的枪吧 会有迷途小鸟飞过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really, Mr. Bond. Take my gun, a stray bird may fly over.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.31,0:30:48.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来是要谢谢你的款待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only stopped to thank you for your hospitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.77,0:30:52.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗瑞瑟会来得及送你到机场去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fraser will get you to the airport in plenty of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.15,0:30:56.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.67,0:31:18.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我的技术可不及你 - 你太谦虚了 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I doubt if I'm in your class. - Oh, you're too modest, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.68,0:31:28.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.15,0:31:38.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你射歪了 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You missed, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.57,0:31:41.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.83,0:31:47.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如你所说 真是好运动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you said, such good sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.89,0:32:13.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你找我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You called for me, Mr. Drax.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.90,0:32:16.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨晚你跟邦德在我的书房里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were with Bond last night in my study.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.11,0:32:17.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的 我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.19,0:32:19.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你把保险箱的位置告诉他 - 我没有!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You showed him the safe. - I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.40,0:32:23.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我解雇你 你马上离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm terminating your employment. You will leave immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.50,0:33:57.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会告诉你在哪里接我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Franco, I'll call you to tell you where to meet me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.56,0:34:20.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能为你介绍些什么东西吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could I interest you in something?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.69,0:34:23.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本来马上就想说有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, I'm tempted to say yes immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.57,0:34:26.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我还是先到处看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I think maybe I'd better have a look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.20,0:34:28.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请随便参观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. Go anywhere you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.95,0:35:15.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1965年 维里尼博物馆和玻璃厂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in 1955, the Venini Museum and Glass Works
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.33,0:35:17.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为崔斯工业所收购\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was taken over by Drax Industries.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.96,0:35:20.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些是最罕见的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here, ladies and gentlemen, we have some of the rarest examples
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.88,0:35:22.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玻璃艺术品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the glassblower's art.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.46,0:35:26.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每件作品都是由人工制造\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you know, everything was done absolutely by hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.76,0:35:29.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个花瓶是在 1850至1860年期间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here is a vase done by Lorenzo Graziati,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.09,0:35:34.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由蓝兰索贾西亚帝制造的 请跟我到这边来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sometime between 1850 and 1860. If you'd like to follow me over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.02,0:35:43.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个精致的碗约在450年前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This exquisite bowl was fashioned about 1520, over 450 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.40,0:35:46.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是1520年非常流行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it ever came on the market, it would certainly fetch a price
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.15,0:35:49.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它的市价超过一百万美元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in excess of one million American dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.74,0:35:52.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过若有人想顺手牵羊的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if any of you are thinking of taking it...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.41,0:35:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个七世纪初的盘子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, we have here a very early 17th century dish
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.29,0:35:58.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绘有海蓝大奖章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with an aquamarine medallion.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.04,0:36:02.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边有一件很有趣的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here, we have something very, very interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.54,0:36:05.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这柄是世上独一无二的剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This glass-handled sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.42,0:36:08.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剑柄是以玻璃铸造的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the only one of its kind in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.01,0:36:12.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在18世纪末 由曼诺帝将军拥有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was owned by General Menotti in the late 18th century
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.80,0:36:14.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是本厂的创办人的杰作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and is the work of Bruno...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.34,0:36:49.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十四世纪作品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}14th century.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.18,0:36:55.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妙算博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Goodhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.30,0:36:58.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你的出现只是巧合 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can only hope your presence here is a coincidence, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.89,0:37:03.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我讨厌被人跟踪 - 有谁不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I dislike being spied on. - Well, don't we all?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.65,0:37:05.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你住在丹尼里饭店吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're staying at the Danieli, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.69,0:37:09.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是的 你怎么知道?  - 我喜欢获得最新消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. How did you know? - Well, I like to keep abreast of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.99,0:37:14.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恕我冒昧 你来威尼斯干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I ask what you're doing in Venice?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.36,0:37:17.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要对欧州太空委员会 进行演讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm addressing a seminar of the European Space Commission.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.91,0:37:19.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真深奥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My, heavy stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.95,0:37:22.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我总是忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there again, I keep forgetting that you are
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.16,0:37:24.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不只是个美女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}more than just a very beautiful woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.71,0:37:29.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若你要讨好我 别浪费时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're trying to be ingratiating, Mr. Bond, don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.21,0:37:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可有更重要的事要想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have more important things on my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.21,0:37:33.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正要跟你谈这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, that's what I'd like to talk to you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.38,0:37:36.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 一起吃晚饭吧?  - 晚上我要演说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dinner this evening? - This evening I'm giving my address.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.89,0:37:40.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,演说完后喝一杯 你没理由拒绝我吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then, can you think of reason why we don't have a drink afterwards?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.81,0:37:43.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在没有 晚一点一定有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not immediately. But I'm sure I shall.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.94,0:37:49.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,法国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Franco.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.61,0:49:05.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再弹一次吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Play it again, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.32,0:49:40.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你在这里干嘛?  - 恢复元气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell are you doing here? - Convalescing.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.44,0:49:43.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的朋友查治要杀我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your friend Cha just tried to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.32,0:49:45.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟这有关系?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you think I had something to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.07,0:49:48.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我突然闪过这念头罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the thought had flashed across my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.91,0:49:55.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 崔斯在那实验室里干什么?  - 你何不亲自问他?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's Drax up to in that laboratory? - Why don't you ask him yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.75,0:50:01.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你会把你的电话号码给我吗?  - 我不觉得这是必要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You leaving me your telephone number? - I don't see the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.67,0:50:05.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, now I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.89,0:50:10.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚不打算遇上这种事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not what I want to get stuck with tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.89,0:50:16.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么不自己去倒杯酒喝?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James, why don't you pour yourself a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.31,0:50:17.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.32,0:50:23.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"日志"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daily diary.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.83,0:50:31.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是死亡日志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fairly deadly diary.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.70,0:50:36.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博林格尔? 如果是六九年的 那你就在等我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bollinger. If it's '69, you were expecting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.14,0:50:58.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这玩意儿盖过了你的香味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trifle overpowering, your scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.20,0:51:10.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,标准的中央情报局装备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Standard CIA equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.91,0:51:13.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们派你混入崔斯吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the CIA placed you with Drax, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.79,0:51:16.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你很聪明 - 并不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Very astute of you, James. - Oh, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.54,0:51:18.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有些基层的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have friends in low places.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.62,0:51:22.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以交换资料吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could this possibly be the moment for us to pool our resources?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.55,0:51:25.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样做会有补偿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It could have its compensations.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.90,0:51:42.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打算到哪去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you planning on going from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.82,0:51:45.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没打算离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not planning on going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.70,0:51:52.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说得对 我们合作 效果会更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I suppose you're right, Holly. We would be better off working together.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.83,0:51:55.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 缓和紧张关系?  - 同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Detente? - Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.91,0:51:58.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 互相谅解?  - 也许吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Understanding? - Possibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.87,0:52:02.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 共同合作?  - 可能吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cooperation? - Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.75,0:52:06.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 彼此信任?  - 不可能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Trust? - Out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.04,0:52:43.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上叫服务员来替我拿行李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send the night porter up for my bags immediately, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.22,0:52:54.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你知道自己在干嘛 我曾经跟他打桥牌的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you know what you're doing, Bond. I've played bridge with this fellow Drax.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.43,0:52:58.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若非事关重大 007也不会惊动我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}007 doesn't usually push the panic button unless it's something serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.14,0:52:59.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 但愿如此 - 早安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I should hope not. - Good morning, Inspector.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.52,0:53:01.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 早 - 你已经跟我们的意大利朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good morning. - I see you've covered everything
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.23,0:53:03.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 把这里掩饰好了 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- with our Italian friends. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.49,0:53:18.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是这个吗?  - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is this it? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.12,0:53:23.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,防毒面具?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gas masks?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.54,0:53:26.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不可以冒险的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't afford to take any chances, Minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.04,0:54:03.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佛雷克葛瑞 真是意外!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frederick Gray. What a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.87,0:54:07.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在著名的公司里 戴上防毒面具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in distinguished company, all wearing gas masks.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.96,0:54:11.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉 由于我不是英国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must excuse me, gentlemen, not being English,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.21,0:54:15.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的无法欣赏你们的幽默感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sometimes find your sense of humor rather difficult to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.56,0:54:23.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我代表英国政府 向你致歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On behalf of the British government, I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.77,0:54:28.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得解释清楚 007\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you owe us an explanation, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.73,0:54:32.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这辈子从没受过如此的屈辱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never been so humiliated in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.03,0:54:35.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要解除他这次的职务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your man should be taken off the assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.40,0:54:37.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,领事馆里见吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you at the consulate.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.37,0:54:40.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得听从他的指示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have to do what he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.70,0:54:45.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你执行任务之前 请叫Q把这个进行分析\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, before you do that, sir, have Q do an analysis of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.79,0:54:48.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从实验室里拿来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took it from the laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.67,0:54:52.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫他千万要小心 这是极其危险的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him to exercise extreme caution. It is lethal.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.59,0:54:55.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来真的有实验室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, there was a laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.93,0:55:00.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你先休息两个星期吧 007\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better take two weeks leave of absence, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.10,0:55:04.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会到哪去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do have any thoughts about where you might go?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.56,0:55:08.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一向都很向往到里约热内卢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've always had a hankering to go to Rio, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.65,0:55:11.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得你曾经提过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I can recall your mentioning it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.61,0:55:16.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再出错否则你我都有麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}007, no slipups or we're both in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.04,0:55:25.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经躲过一次小型危机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, a minor crisis has been averted.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.04,0:55:28.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问题不大 但从今天开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, nothing serious, but all merchandise
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.58,0:55:31.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得改变货物的运送路线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is to be rerouted as from today.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.84,0:55:34.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于查治的代替者方面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, regarding a replacement for Cha,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.76,0:55:37.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有适当的人选吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do you have someone in mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.97,0:55:40.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 若你找到他就最好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes, well, if you can get him, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.85,0:55:46.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,BA128号班机 开往里约热内卢 乘客请从七号闸登机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flight BA128 to Rio de Janeiro now boarding, gate number seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.51,0:56:22.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎你来到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Rio, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.72,0:57:07.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是总统套房 - 真的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The President Suite. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.02,0:57:12.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不用带我参观了 若我迷路 自会叫计程车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, don't bother showing me the rest. If I get lost, I'll take a cab.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.75,0:57:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你也是套房的服务之一?  - 这得看住的是谁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you come with the suite? - It depends who's renting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.58,0:57:37.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伏特加马丁尼? 摇动 不要搅拌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vodka martini? Shaken not stirred.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.26,0:57:41.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干嘛从机场跟踪我来到这里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why were you following me from the airport?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.67,0:57:45.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要认识你 我叫曼露娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was trying to meet you. My name is Manuela.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.14,0:57:49.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在VH部门工作 有人请我们协助你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I work for Station VH. We have been asked to assist you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.31,0:57:51.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,M真是设想周到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}M thinks of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.77,0:57:55.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请问卡威有什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, Manuela, do the initials C and W mean anything to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.27,0:57:59.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡威? 是卡洛斯与威斯堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}C and W? Yes, Carlos and Wilmsberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.07,0:58:02.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是本地很大的进口商\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are very big importers in Rio.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.28,0:58:05.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信是崔斯工业的子公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A subsidiary of the Drax Group, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.28,0:58:08.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在凯利欧加大道有个仓库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have a warehouse on Carioca Avenue.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.45,0:58:10.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天晚上我要谨慎地夜访仓库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to pay it a discreet visit tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.66,0:58:15.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天晚上? 可能会有点困难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight? I think you may find that a little difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.21,0:58:19.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,困难与否 我们也得去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Difficult or not, it's something we have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.84,0:58:22.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与此同时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And meanwhile,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.30,0:58:26.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若不跳舞 你会如何打发五小时?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how do you kill five hours in Rio if you don't samba?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.00,0:58:56.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 仓库在那里 - 一个人都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's the warehouse. - And not a soul about.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.04,0:59:00.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 后面应该有入口 - 好提议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I think there's a way around the back. - Good thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.08,0:59:35.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.54,0:59:39.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别跟陌生人说话 我很快回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't talk to any strange men. I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.09,1:02:36.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧?  - 我没事 但我情愿与你跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you all right? - Yes, but I'd rather dance with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.89,1:02:40.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早说过别跟陌生人说话的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did tell you not to talk to any strange men.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.14,1:02:44.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你在里面有发现吗?  - 只有这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you find anything in there? - Only this.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.90,1:02:48.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"崔斯空运"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Drax Air Freight."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.11,1:02:49.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在哪个机场运作?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know which airport they operate from?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.65,1:02:53.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣彼得机场 要我带你去吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. San Pietro. Do you want me to take you there?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.11,1:02:55.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了 你需要休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I think you need some rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.90,1:02:57.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我送你回去 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. I'll drop you off. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.83,1:04:33.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们不是见过面的?  - 这副脸孔和态度都很熟悉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Haven't we met before somewhere? - The face is familiar, as is the manner.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.84,1:04:37.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在比在威尼斯后更冷了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's become distinctly chilly since Venice.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.34,1:04:39.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是在你离去之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that was before you walked out on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.26,1:04:42.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差点被你放在通道上的行李绊倒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, nearly tripping over your suitcase on the way through the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.30,1:04:43.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那又如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.68,1:04:47.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为何要浪费时间跟对方作对?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So why waste time working against each other?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.68,1:04:51.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经看过崔斯在这里的仓库 里面空空如也\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've checked Drax's warehouse in town. It's empty.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.06,1:04:53.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意料中事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's no surprise. Since I've been here,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.56,1:04:55.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞机每两小时开出一班\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}those planes have been taking off every two hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.02,1:04:59.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他在搬离 - 到哪去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. He's moving out. - Where to?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.61,1:05:02.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这正是我们要调查的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what we're going to find out,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.53,1:05:04.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得合作找出答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}now that we're working together.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.75,1:05:14.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我仍然不知道你是否可靠 - 我也不知道你是否可靠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I still don't know if I trust you. - I don't know if I trust you either.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.88,1:05:19.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样不是更刺激吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what makes it more exciting, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.41,1:05:54.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么了?  - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's wrong? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.04,1:05:57.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们还是离开这里吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm sure we're better off out than in.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.84,1:06:00.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把铁链带走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring that chain.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.62,1:06:31.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 撑着点! 詹姆斯 - 我也是这样想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hang on, James. - The thought had occurred to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.03,1:07:13.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该料到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I might have guessed.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.12,1:07:15.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你认识他吗?  - 算不上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you know him? - Not socially.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.66,1:07:18.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫大钢牙 是杀手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name's Jaws. He kills people.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.90,1:08:31.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铁链给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, give me the chain.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.08,1:08:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 抱紧我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Hang on to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.67,1:09:22.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jump.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.48,1:10:32.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你有受伤吗?  - 只是伤了裁缝的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have you broken something? - Only my tailor's heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.37,1:10:40.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么要这样做?  - 你救了我一命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What was that for? - For saving my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.04,1:10:43.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你提醒我应多点救你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remind me to do it more often.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.88,1:10:58.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢了 我们没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, thank you, but we're in great shape.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.79,1:12:10.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.07,1:14:09.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹姆斯!  你像从山上掉下来似的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James! You look as though you've just fallen off a mountain.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.24,1:14:11.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真幽默 钱班霓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's funny you should say that, Moneypenny.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.70,1:14:15.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上 我在苐车上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a matter of fact, I was in a cable car and...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.54,1:14:18.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 算了吧 - 在另一边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Never mind. - The other courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.34,1:14:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你来了 007 - 是球吗 Q?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ah, there you are, 007. - Balls, Q?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.89,1:14:27.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是流星锤 007\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bolas, 007.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.98,1:14:44.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好极了 建军节那天要准备好 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good. Have that ready for Army Day. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.74,1:14:47.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- M在哪?  - 在办公室里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's M? - He's in the office over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.59,1:15:00.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.26,1:15:04.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 早安 007 - 早安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good morning, 007. - Good morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.76,1:15:08.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你来得正好 请坐 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're just in time. Sit down. - Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.60,1:15:12.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Q有发现 - 好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Q's come up with something. - Splendid.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.06,1:15:17.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有妙算博士的消息吗?  - 恐怕没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Any news of Dr. Goodhead? - Afraid not. Right, Q.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.27,1:15:21.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把你在威尼斯得到的液体 进行分解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's a breakdown on that phial of liquid you picked up in Venice.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.27,1:15:24.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你似乎是对的 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know, you seem to be right, 007. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.19,1:15:29.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是毒性猛烈的神经毒气 但对动物没影响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a highly toxic nerve gas that appears to have no effect on animals.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.12,1:15:31.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以看看程式吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I see the formula?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.79,1:15:42.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一种植物的化学程式式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a chemical formula of a plant.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.01,1:15:48.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑兰花 一种极为稀有的兰花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Orchideae anegra. A very rare orchid indeed.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.80,1:15:51.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们以为它已绝种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. It was thought to be extinct.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.18,1:15:55.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直至一名传教士 在阿犸索可山上把一朵带回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until a missionary brought one back from the upper reaches of the Amazoco.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.31,1:15:58.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实是从 塔比拉比河附近带回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, actually he brought it back from the area of the River Tapirape.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.35,1:16:02.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得好 你尽快赶去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done, James. You better get up there and fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.36,1:16:07.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有东西可以送他过去 若他会照顾它的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I've got something to get him there, if 007 can be trusted to look after it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.22,1:24:17.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦德先生 我要让你痛快的死去 你却藐视我的大计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Bond, you defy all my attempts to plan an amusing death for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.69,1:24:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没有运动家的品格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not a sportsman, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.48,1:24:23.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为何你要打断 跟蟒蛇之间的相遇?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you break off the encounter with my pet python?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.65,1:24:26.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发觉他爱上了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I discovered he had a crush on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.03,1:24:28.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大钢牙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jaws.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.87,1:24:43.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者一号准备好发射 两分钟后升空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moonraker One on preset launch program, minus two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.46,1:24:45.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撤回工作人员通道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Retract crew access arm.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.92,1:24:48.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通道已经撤回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}CAA retracted.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.34,1:24:52.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 传送宇宙飞船的能量 - 内部能量已经传送\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Transfer orbiter power. - Internal power transferred.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.18,1:24:54.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,启动水压器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Activate hydraulics.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.14,1:24:57.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 水压器已经启动 - 启动辅助能源组件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hydraulics activated. - Activate auxiliary power unit.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.06,1:25:02.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 已经启动 - 添加燃料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- APU activated. - LH2 replenish.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.15,1:25:06.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 状态确定 - 替氦气缸加压\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Status confirmed. - Pressurize MPS helium tanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.57,1:25:08.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,气压确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Helium flight pressure confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.36,1:25:13.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你究竟在干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What exactly are you up to here, Drax?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.57,1:25:17.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为何是兰花?  - 这是文明的诅咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And why the orchids? - The curse of a civilization.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.58,1:25:20.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,建立这个城市的人并非因战火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was neither war nor pestilence that wiped out the race
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.58,1:25:24.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或瘟疫而绝种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who built the great city lying around us.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.25,1:25:27.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是由于他们对这朵花的敬意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was their reverence for this lovely flower.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.55,1:25:32.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们长期吸入花粉 导致不孕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because long-term exposure to its pollen caused sterility.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.43,1:25:34.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说得对 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Correct, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.51,1:25:38.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也发觉到 我已把种子改良\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you discovered, I have improved upon sterility.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.23,1:25:41.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在那些种子都坏死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those same seeds now yield death.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.06,1:25:47.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 它对动植物无害 人类得保持大自然的平衡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not, of course, to animals or plant life. One must preserve the balance of nature.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.78,1:25:50.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者号的发射程序开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moonraker launch program now commencing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.49,1:25:51.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,倒数二十秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Minus 20 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.07,1:25:55.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 平衡环 - 已经启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- SRB gimbal profile. - Activated.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.62,1:25:56.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 冷却帮浦 - 启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cooling pumps. - On.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.95,1:25:59.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 惯性IMU - 确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- IMU to inertial. - IMU confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.87,1:26:02.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者一号发射升空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moonraker One, liftoff.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.00,1:26:11.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经升空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have liftoff.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.42,1:26:18.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者二号 倒数十秒 九 八 七 六\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moonraker Two, T minus ten, nine, eight, seven, six,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.64,1:26:24.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五 四 三 二 一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}five, four, three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.10,1:26:26.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主引擎开动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Main engine start.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.36,1:26:29.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者二号发射升空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moonraker Two, liftoff.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.24,1:26:37.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 垦月者三号 - 垦月者三号发射升空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Moonraker Three. - Moonraker Three, liftoff.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.41,1:26:40.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 垦月者二号 确认程序 - 程序已确认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Moonraker Two, confirm program pitch. - PP confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.08,1:26:43.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者四号 开始发射程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moonraker Four on preset launch program.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.66,1:26:45.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者四号发射升空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moonraker Four, liftoff.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.00,1:26:48.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者一号 投弃燃料缸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moonraker One, SRB jettison.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.59,1:26:53.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经确定分离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have separation. Confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.84,1:26:57.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者三号 确认程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moonraker Three, confirm program pitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.09,1:27:00.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者五号 开始发射程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moonraker Five, on preset launch program.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.31,1:27:03.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 倒数十秒 - 崔斯 还有一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Minus ten... - Drax, one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.81,1:27:06.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把太空梭交给美国政府\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You delivered a shuttle to the U.S. government,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.35,1:27:09.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后又把它劫持 为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then you hijacked it. Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.61,1:27:12.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我需要它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I needed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.07,1:27:17.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一艘垦月者号 在装配时出现问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of my own Moonrakers developed a fault during assembly.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.82,1:27:20.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经因你而很分心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you have distracted me enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.37,1:27:25.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦德先生在游泳后一定很冷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jaws, Mr. Bond must be cold after his swim.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.54,1:27:28.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带他到保证温暖的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Place him where he can be assured of warmth.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.38,1:27:31.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 确定 - 垦月者二号 进入轨道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Confirmed. - Moonraker Two, go for orbit.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.05,1:27:34.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,速度每秒钟一千尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Velocity, 1,000 feet per second.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.09,1:27:36.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 所有系统正常... - 投弃燃料缸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All systems... - SRB jettison.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.43,1:27:39.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,分离发动机点火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Separation motors fired.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.47,1:27:44.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者五号准备升空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moonraker Five, cleared for launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.32,1:27:59.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.79,1:28:05.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢天谢地 你没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank God, you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.46,1:28:09.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者五号 传送飞船能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moonraker Five, transfer orbiter power.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.01,1:28:26.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,启动水力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hydraulics activated.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.73,1:28:30.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 启动辅助能源组件 - 已经启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Activate auxiliary power unit. - APU activated.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.69,1:28:33.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 添加燃料 - 确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- LH2 replenish. - Confirm.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.82,1:28:37.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使对死亡 我仍很宽宏大量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even in death, my munificence is boundless.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.19,1:28:39.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当火箭升空时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When this rocket lifts off,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.66,1:28:42.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会把你留在 你私人的火葬场里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall be leaving you in your own private crematorium.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.33,1:28:47.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦德先生 妙算博士 再见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Bond, Dr. Goodhead, I bid you farewell.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.96,1:28:53.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- EPS能源启动 - 能源已经启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- EPS, power on. - EPS, power confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.68,1:29:01.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到通风口去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, the air vent.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.31,1:29:07.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,输入气流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuel tanks go, and go.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.90,1:29:16.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者五号准备就绪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moonraker Five, preset.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.78,1:29:19.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外置LH2压力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}External LH2 pressure.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.20,1:29:26.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 撤回工作人员通道 - 已经撤回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Retract crew access arm. - CAA retracted.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.79,1:29:28.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退后 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.46,1:29:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,倒数十秒 九\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}T minus ten seconds, nine,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.84,1:29:39.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,七\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}seven,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.13,1:29:41.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 六 五 四... - 时间刚好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- six, five, four... - Bang on time.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.68,1:29:44.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 四 三 二... - 快点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- four, three, two... - Come on, quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.68,1:29:49.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往前爬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Straight on.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.86,1:30:05.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者六号的太空技师 准备登船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moonraker Six, astro-technicians prepare to embark.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.79,1:30:13.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重复: 垦月者六号的太空技师 准备登船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat, Moonraker Six astro-technicians, prepare to embark.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.34,1:30:21.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 垦月者五号的人员 - 所有系统正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Moonraker Five crew. - All systems go.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.64,1:30:28.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者六号 开始发射程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moonraker Six, start launch sequence.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.23,1:30:35.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 进入轨迹 - 证实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go for orbit. - Confirm.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.27,1:30:38.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经分离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have separation.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.07,1:30:42.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者五号的地面员工 留守岗位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moonraker Five ground crew stand down.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.36,1:30:44.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,推力: 680万磅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thrust 6.8 million pounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.09,1:31:05.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走错方向了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.89,1:31:15.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者六号 发射程序完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moonraker Six, preset launch program completed.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.81,1:31:18.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,驾驶员请到发射地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pilots proceed from base to launch area.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.29,1:31:35.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太空梭准备好 推进器准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shuttle go. Boosters go.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.71,1:31:38.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发射台准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Launch pad go.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.38,1:31:42.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 外置L2压力 - 确认每平方英寸21\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- External LO2 pressure? - Confirmed, 21 psia.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.75,1:31:48.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 外置LH2压力 - 确认: 42.5\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- External LH2 pressure? - Confirmed, 42.5 psia.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.18,1:31:50.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 转入内置能源 - 通道已经撤回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- IECF to internal power. - CAA retracted.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.97,1:31:54.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者六号可以升空 倒数十秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moonraker Six cleared for launch. T minus 10 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.93,1:32:00.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九 八 七 六 五 四\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine, eight, seven, six, five, four,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.81,1:32:04.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三 二 一 发射!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}three, two, one, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.19,1:32:07.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的 飞行程序已预先设定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right. We're on a prearranged flight program.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.21,1:33:00.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,崔斯在垦月者五号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Drax in Moonraker Five.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.35,1:33:17.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 其它人呢?  - 不知道 我们看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What about the others? - I don't know. Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.40,1:33:23.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有太空梭都在平衡的轨道上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're all on parallel courses.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.90,1:33:26.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们正前去集合地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, we must be headed for a rendezvous in orbit.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.49,1:34:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看我们的货物是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see what cargo we have.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.29,1:34:30.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- "动物一双一对的走进去" - 什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The animals went in two by two. - What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.80,1:34:33.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次行动是诺亚方舟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noah's Ark. This operation.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.00,1:35:04.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会合了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're converging.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.34,1:35:13.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 要控制火箭?  - 对 我们正在减速\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Control rockets? - Yes, we're slowing down.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.47,1:35:20.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.88,1:35:57.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷达上并没有影像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no image on the radar scanner.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.73,1:36:16.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是太空里的城市 雷达却什么也探测不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An entire city in space and still nothing on the radar scanner.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.40,1:36:20.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 地球上没有人知道它的存在 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So nobody on Earth knows it's there. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.45,1:36:25.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,崔斯一定有雷达干扰装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drax must have a radar-jamming system.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.66,1:36:30.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者号 启动靠岸程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All Moonrakers prepare to initiate docking procedures
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.92,1:36:33.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保持无线电寂静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and continue radio silence.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.53,1:37:03.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者六号 开始人工操作 启动靠岸程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moonraker Six, you are now in manual. Initiate docking sequence.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.88,1:37:23.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有太空梭已靠岸 执行启动太空站程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All shuttles now docked. Execute station activation procedure.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.48,1:39:00.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重力维持正常 维生系统正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gravity, normal conditions. Life-support system, nominal.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.69,1:39:06.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者六号的技师 启动操作程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moonraker Six technicians, commence operational sequence.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.82,1:39:09.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 开始程序四 - 检查气闸封口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sequence four initiated. - Check airlock seals.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.95,1:39:11.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经关紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ALS secure.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.04,1:39:21.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人员请到指挥卫星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All personnel to Command satellite.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.26,1:39:25.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人员请到指挥卫星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All personnel to Command satellite.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.80,1:39:32.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人员请到M5区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All crews to M5 segment.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.10,1:39:35.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者六号的技师 请到M2区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moonraker Six technicians to M2 segment.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.89,1:39:39.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者一号及三号的技师 请到M1区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moonraker One and Three to M1 segment.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.27,1:39:43.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者四号及五号的技师 请到M4区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moonraker Four and Five to M4 segment.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.94,1:39:47.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者二号的技师 请到M5区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moonraker Two to M5 segment.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.99,1:39:52.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第四及第七队 照计划操作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Units four and seven, man console as planned.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.37,1:39:57.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一 三 五及六组 到预先分配好的岗位就位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Units one, three, five and six, assume pre-assigned stations.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.62,1:39:59.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 联线压力 - 确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pressure on-line? - Confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.00,1:40:01.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 维生系统 - 正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Life support? - Normal.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.63,1:40:10.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在威尼斯见过那些圆球 里面充满神经毒气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those are the globes I saw in Venice with the nerve gas phials inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.52,1:40:20.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先是一个梦想 现在它已经成为事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First there was a dream. Now there is reality.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.31,1:40:25.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这个无污染的天国摇篮里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here in the untainted cradle of the heavens
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.32,1:40:28.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个新的超级民族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will be created a new super-race,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.49,1:40:33.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个拥有完美肉体的种族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a race of perfect physical specimens.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.24,1:40:38.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们被挑选成为他们的祖先 跟众神一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have been selected as its progenitors, like gods.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.33,1:40:43.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的子孙会重返地球 根据自己的形象把它改造\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your offspring will return to Earth and shape it in their image.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.38,1:40:48.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都是我的王国里的子民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have all served in humble capacities in my terrestrial empire.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.13,1:40:50.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟你们一样 你们的后代要尊重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your seed, like yourselves,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.34,1:40:56.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个由我一手创办的王国里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will pay deference to the ultimate dynasty which I alone have created.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.39,1:41:01.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从他们在地球上的第一天 他们举头望天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From their first day on Earth they will be able to look up
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.35,1:41:06.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会知道在天堂上有法纪和秩序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and know that there is law and order in the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.40,1:41:12.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各单位 开始兰花行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All units, start Operation Orchid.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.16,1:41:20.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若地球的人看的到我们 他们定会调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we were visible from Earth, they'd investigate.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.25,1:41:23.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为雷达干扰系统会在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do you suppose that radar-jamming system is?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.25,1:41:27.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来的时候没经过任何东西 就这边吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't pass anything on the way here, so let's try this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.80,1:41:31.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二号岗位 检查座标 第四模式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Station two, check coordinates, mode four.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.09,1:41:36.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,启动圆球发射计时程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Initiate globe launch timing sequence.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.72,1:41:39.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轨迹发报机 第十层 没有重力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Orbital communicator, level 10. Zero gravity.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.00,1:42:07.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这里了 雷达干扰系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is it, the radar-jamming system.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.55,1:42:15.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 协调变换程式 - 有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Coordinate conversion program. - Check.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.43,1:42:18.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 附属波瓣 - 有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Side lobe gain. - Check.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.02,1:42:21.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 光谱频率响应 - 有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Spectral response. - Check.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.98,1:42:27.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 旋转稳定器 修正系数 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Spin stabilizer correction factor. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.94,1:42:30.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千兆赫反射器效率\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gigahertz reflector efficiency.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.70,1:42:34.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太阳光子过滤器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Solar photon screen.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.09,1:42:58.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在太空总署学会打架的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you learn to fight like that? NASA?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.47,1:42:59.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 在瓦萨尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Vassar.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.98,1:43:12.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 关上了没有?  - 永久关上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Switched off? - Permanently.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.69,1:43:14.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球上的人可以看见我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we can be spotted from Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.49,1:43:22.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 糟透了 - 直径超过二百米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This doesn't look good at all. - It's over 200 meters in diameter.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.66,1:43:25.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.16,1:43:28.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听清楚 不是我们放上去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you please listen, General Gogol? We didn't put it up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.46,1:43:33.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不是我们干的 史考特上校 你有什么建议?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither did we, Colonel Scott. So what are you suggesting?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.63,1:43:37.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已派了太空船去拦截他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've taken action already. We're sending up a vehicle to intercept.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.47,1:43:41.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 但若十二小时内没有回音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well, but if we don't hear from you in the next 12 hours
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.18,1:43:44.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们将采取行动 后果由你们负责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we take action ourselves and hold you responsible for the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.35,1:43:48.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保持联络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be in touch, General.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.98,1:43:52.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 抱歉把你弄醒 - 我已经醒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sorry to have woken you. - I was already awake.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.11,1:43:57.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么能入睡?  除了烦恼什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can I sleep? Nothing but problems.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.49,1:44:00.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,烦恼 烦恼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Problems, problems.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.62,1:44:03.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三名太空人正朝发射台去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marine astronauts to launch pad.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.09,1:44:17.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- B发射程序完成 - 发射一号圆球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Launch pre-program complete, sir. - Launch globe number one.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.94,1:45:18.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球有太空船升空 在美洲范登堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}T.D.R.S.S. reports a launch, sir. Continental U.S.A. Vandenberg.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.78,1:45:25.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该没有发射计划的 检查雷达干扰系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are no launches scheduled. Check radar-jamming system.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.08,1:45:30.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.16,1:45:33.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,系统电力供应 和后备电源中断了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jamming power supply and backup have failed, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.46,1:45:37.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 马上调查 - 马上调查28号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Investigate immediately. - Investigate number 28, immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.26,1:45:41.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.72,1:45:46.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟一个不可避免的 而且令人厌恶的季节 一同出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You appear with the tedious inevitability of an unloved season.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.06,1:45:49.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不以为太空里会有季节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't think there were any seasons in space.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.93,1:45:53.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对你来说 只会有冬天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As far as you're concerned, only winter.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.48,1:45:56.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有狡猾的妙算博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the treacherous Dr. Goodhead.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.57,1:46:01.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你如何努力阻扰 我的梦想快要成真了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Despite your efforts, my finely wrought dream approaches its fulfillment.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.40,1:46:06.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你有什么妄想 都不会成真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your dream, whatever sort of nightmare it is, hasn't a chance, Drax.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.16,1:46:09.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗? 我们走着瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think not? We shall see.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.37,1:46:11.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二次发射开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're coming up to second launch position.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.96,1:46:13.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发射二号圆球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Launch globe number two.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.30,1:46:29.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经明白我的构想了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No doubt you have realized the splendor of my conception.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.72,1:46:33.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先用一条死亡项链围绕地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, a necklace of death about the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.35,1:46:39.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五十个圆球 各自在指定地方 释放神经毒气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}50 globes, each releasing its nerve gas over a designated area,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.40,1:46:43.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个球体可以杀死一亿人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}each capable of killing 100 million people.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.53,1:46:49.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么一来 人类就会绝种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the human race as you know it will cease to exist.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.41,1:46:53.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后是再生 一个新世界就诞生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then a rebirth, a new world.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.04,1:46:56.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国的太空船要拦截我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}U.S. spacecraft on course to intercept us, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.63,1:47:02.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,启动雷射炮 准备把太空船击落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Activate laser. Prepare to destroy spacecraft.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.73,1:47:21.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们绝对有能力保护自己 对付任何敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, my dear Bond, we're well able to protect ourselves against all enemies.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.15,1:47:28.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,容我给你介绍 这个没有空气的密室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Allow me to introduce you to the airlock chamber.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.95,1:47:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看你从这个世界 走到另一个世界的路线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Observe, Mr. Bond, your route from this world to the next.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.80,1:47:42.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有你 妙算博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you, Dr. Goodhead.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.42,1:47:45.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要成为美国首位女太空人 的渴望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your desire to be America's first woman in space
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.22,1:47:47.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快就会实现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will shortly be fulfilled.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.26,1:47:52.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你留在飞行配种站里 接受新种的配种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leaving you on your flying stud farm, conceiving your new master race?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.77,1:47:54.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你愿意 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you like, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.06,1:48:00.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何外形达不到 你的完美标准的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And of course, anyone not measuring up to your standards of physical perfection
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.52,1:48:04.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 都会被消灭 - 当然是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- will be exterminated. - Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.82,1:48:09.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.78,1:48:11.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有趣极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most interesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.24,1:48:14.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大钢牙 驱逐他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jaws, expel them.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.46,1:48:22.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要服从我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jaws! You obey me!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.80,1:48:30.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,驱逐他们!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Expel them!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.02,1:48:44.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓着他们!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold them!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.78,1:48:50.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国太空船三分钟后到达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, U.S. spacecraft, three minutes to intercept.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.53,1:48:53.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备消灭他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand by to laser it.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.46,1:49:05.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 启动开火程序 - 已经开动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Initiate firing sequence. - Initiating.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.09,1:49:10.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国太空船已进入射程范围 二十五点五 正在接近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}U.S. spacecraft in laser range, 25.5 and closing.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.76,1:49:13.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,射程十五\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Range 15.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.35,1:49:14.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,射程十\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Range 10.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.56,1:49:24.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备开火 五 四 三 二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare to fire. Five, four, three, two...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.05,1:49:48.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它停止转动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's stopped rotating.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.42,1:50:27.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打开仓库舱门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the cargo doors.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.51,1:50:36.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一队 出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Number one platoon, EVA.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.60,1:50:38.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一队 出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Number one platoon, EVA.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.49,1:51:37.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尝试靠岸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's try docking.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.44,1:52:16.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,占领一楼平台!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel Scott will take the first landing!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.45,1:52:19.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,入侵者在七号卫星着陆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Intruders have docked at satellite seven, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.62,1:52:23.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加强守卫 保护来这里的通道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Double the guard at every entrance in this satellite.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.33,1:52:26.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,报告入侵者 在太空站内的一举一动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Report intruders' progress throughout the space station.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.21,1:52:28.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三号圆球已准备好发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Number three globe ready for launching, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.50,1:52:29.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续下去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Proceed!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.18,1:52:43.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全体人员听着 格杀勿论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Group One, attack enemy. All units shoot to kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.23,1:52:54.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 上校 别开火 - 别开枪!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Colonel Scott, don't shoot. - Hold your fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.73,1:52:59.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,渗入五号走廊 入侵者正向指挥卫星进发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Corridor five penetrated. Intruders advancing on Command satellite.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.91,1:53:02.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第三区需要维修人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maintenance crew needed, section three.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.18,1:54:13.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最少我很乐意 除掉你这伙眼中钉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least I shall have the pleasure of putting you out of my misery.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.44,1:54:18.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很凄凉吧? 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Desolated, Mr. Bond?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.53,1:54:24.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使人心碎 崔斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heartbroken, Mr. Drax.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.66,1:54:27.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,容许我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Allow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.20,1:54:32.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为人类跨出一大步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a giant step for mankind.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.76,1:54:51.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 崔斯在哪?  - 他必须要去飞行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's Drax? - He had to fly.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.52,1:54:53.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史考特怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's Scott doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.64,1:54:54.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他已控制了指挥卫星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got control of the Command satellite.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.90,1:54:57.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发射圆球的装置已经关闭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We put the launching gear for the globes out of action.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.31,1:55:00.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当太空站解体时 它们也会分解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the station breaks up, they'll disintegrate. They'll harm no one.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.78,1:55:02.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剩下的三个 也足以干掉数百万人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the three that have gone, they'll kill millions.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.90,1:55:05.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要把它们消灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those three must be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.29,1:55:18.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.18,1:55:27.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快叫你的部下离开这里!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel, get your men off as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.80,1:55:29.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任务已经完结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mission is completed.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.93,1:55:32.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上命令手下返回太空梭!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sergeant, round up your men, get them back to the shuttle. Fast!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.68,1:55:34.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,返回太空梭 马上离开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back to the shuttle, everybody! On the double!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.71,1:56:03.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垦月者5号配备有雷射枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moonraker Five, that's the answer. Drax's shuttle is armed with a laser.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.76,1:56:06.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以追踪并摧毁圆球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can track those globes and destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.80,1:56:11.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没希望了 走廊被封住了 他们无法来到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's hopeless, sir. The corridor's blocked. They can't get to us now.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.89,1:56:13.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.81,1:57:03.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发射系统被卡住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Docking release system is jammed.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.72,1:57:35.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,松开门锁 我尝试用人工操作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Release the door lock. I'll see if I can operate it manually.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.64,1:57:37.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也失灵了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's jammed too.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.45,1:57:54.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为我们干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, here's to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.30,1:58:14.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大钢牙? 我们无法离开 发射系统被卡住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jaws, we can't disengage. The docking release system is jammed.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.14,1:58:16.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能帮忙吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you help us?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:40.62,1:58:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们脱身了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're free.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:57.64,1:59:01.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们没事的 这里距离地球 只有一百里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, they'll make it. It's only 100 miles to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:01.52,1:59:03.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寻找圆球的下落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get a read-out on those globes.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.21,1:59:29.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,银幕上有影像了 我们很快就会看到圆球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have the three globes on the screen. We should have a visual in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.47,1:59:39.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.98,1:59:47.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷射枪自动瞄准目标 密码945 准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The laser's on automatic. Code 945 set.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.16,2:00:04.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,击落一个 还有两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One down, two to go.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.75,2:00:10.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二号就在前面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Number two straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:18.18,2:00:19.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.22,2:00:21.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在大气层表面掠过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're skipping on the Earth's atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.56,2:00:22.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进入射程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In range.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:32.52,2:00:37.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 很快就会看见最后一个 - 在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We should see the last one soon. - There it is.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.16,2:00:49.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 越来越热了 - 我也束手无策\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's getting hot. - It can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:49.21,2:00:53.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们比原定轨道来得倾斜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming in at a steeper angle than I should in order to catch that last globe.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.47,2:01:05.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我无法继续保持这条航道 我们会在二千万尺上空解体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't hold this course much longer. We'll break up at 200,000 feet.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.52,2:01:07.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我多一点时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a few seconds more.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:17.53,2:01:22.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自动点火系统失灵 一定是高热 改由人工操作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Automatic firing system negative. Must be the heat. Switching to manual.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:37.26,2:01:39.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,操纵装置没有反应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Controls aren't responding.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:42.43,2:01:45.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 机翼开始燃烧 - 别摇动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The wings are beginning to glow. - Just hold her steady.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:48.39,2:01:49.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稳住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steady.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:04.20,2:02:08.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它要进入地球大气层了 这是最后一次机会了 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's entering Earth's atmosphere! James, this is our last chance.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:12.04,2:02:13.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稳住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steady.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.48,2:02:35.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史考特上校在太空站中 救回两名生还者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel Scott reports picking up two survivors from the space station,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:35.90,2:02:38.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是一个高个子和矮小的金发妞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a tall man and a short blonde woman.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.11,2:02:40.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:40.90,2:02:43.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妙算博士在二十分钟前 报告过位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Goodhead reported their position 20 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:43.57,2:02:46.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们已进入我们在太平洋的 追踪船的范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're just coming into range of our tracking ship in the Pacific Ocean.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:46.78,2:02:48.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们很快可以接收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should have audiovisual within a few minutes
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.33,2:02:49.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的影像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the remote onboard TV monitors.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.92,2:02:58.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休斯顿呼叫妙算博士 休斯顿呼叫 请确定位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Houston calling Dr. Goodhead. Houston calling. Confirm your position.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:04.51,2:03:07.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是英美两国首次联合行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As this is the first joint venture between our two countries,
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.05,2:03:11.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把影像直接传送到 白宫和白金汉宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm having it patched directly to the White House and Buckingham Palace.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:11.73,2:03:14.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我确定女皇陛下会很着迷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm sure Her Majesty will be fascinated.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:14.77,2:03:17.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 还有视听划面 - 终于有了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We have audiovisual. - Ah, at last.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:27.37,2:03:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 007 - 天啊 邦德在干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 007. - My God, what's Bond doing?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:31.29,2:03:33.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在尝试重新进入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think he's attempting re-entry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:47.14,2:03:50.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 詹姆斯?  - 是时候回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- James? - I think it may be time to go home.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:50.68,2:03:54.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再带我环游世界一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take me round the world one more time.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:54.14,2:03:56.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有何不可?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not?
